"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Morgan County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids February to March and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 151% of normal and August to September at 66%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 43% on the middle. Grid 23293 had its driest year in 1987 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
